            "review_title": "Review at Blue - Canh & Chan Ga Nuong",
            "review_text": "Snowboardergrls\nPensacola, Florida91 contributions\n0\nthe best charcoal bbq grilled chicken wings I have ever had\nNov 2016 • Solo\nWe are weary of eating street food in Vietnam given the cleanliness of many places. I so glad that I found Mr. Bon's charcoal grilled chicken wings. They are amazing and his set up is very clean with waste baskets under each table, new plastic chairs and tables, covered marinated meats prepared fresh, and chicken wings grilled to order. \n\nThe lemongrass and garlic marinade flavors really come through and his attention to detail by personally grilling and turning each bbq chicken wing on the skewer led to heaven in my mouth. My husband (who typically refuses to eat street food), 2 year old (who practically never eats), and I could not stop eating the chicken wings because they were so good. My husband now suggests eating here for dinner every night of our trip.\n\nThey also deliver and do take out since I see lots of folks coming for delivery and take out. Check out their awesome spicy green sauce made of green chilis and garlic + secret seasoning. It was really good.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 23, 2016",
